  "prefLabel": "Plc 1101.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1101.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any individual who intends to practice or who does actually practice reflexology, structural integration, or Asian bodywork therapy in New Hampshire, except as provided by RSA 328-H:13, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36",
